<title>USA: MBIA qualifies District of Columbia for insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies District of Columbia for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp. said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance the District of Columbia's $233.9 million general obligation bond deal, set for competitive sale at noon EDT.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
